// Dependencies for THIS function, kept in THIS directory on purpose.
//
// The hosted bundler resolves a function's configuration from the function's
// own directory. A shared `supabase/functions/deno.json` is found by the local
// `deno` CLI, which walks up from the entry point — but it is not what the
// deploy reads, so every bare specifier in the graph arrives unmapped:
//
//   Relative import path "zod" not prefixed with / or ./ or ../
//
// `zod` was simply the first one reported. `@anthropic-ai/sdk` and
// `@supabase/supabase-js` are equally unresolvable and fail next.
//
// The versions are pinned exactly, to what `supabase/functions/deno.lock`
// already resolved. `scripts/check-function-imports.ts` asserts that these
// files agree with each other and with the shared config, and that every bare
// specifier reachable from either entry point has a mapping here — which is
// the check that would have caught this before a deploy did.
{
  "imports": {
    "@anthropic-ai/sdk": "npm:@anthropic-ai/sdk@0.125.0",
    "@supabase/supabase-js": "npm:@supabase/supabase-js@2.116.0",
    "zod": "npm:zod@4.6.2"
  },
  "compilerOptions": {
    "lib": [
      "deno.window",
      "esnext"
    ],
    "strict": true
  }
}
